Value INTERFACE ([\w.-]+(?:\s+\d+(?:/\d+)*(?:\.\d+)?)?|\S+)
Value STATUS (administratively down|admin down|up|down|\S+)
Value VLAN (\d+|routed|\S+)
Value DUPLEX (\S+)
Value SPEED (\S+)
Value TYPE (\S+)

Start
  ^Interface\s+Status\s+Vlan\s+Duplex\s+Speed\s+Type
  ^-+
  ^${INTERFACE}\s{2,}${STATUS}\s{2,}${VLAN}\s{2,}${DUPLEX}\s{2,}${SPEED}\s{2,}${TYPE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${INTERFACE}\s{2,}${STATUS}\s{2,}${DUPLEX}\s{2,}${SPEED}\s{2,}${TYPE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${STATUS}\s+${VLAN}\s+${DUPLEX}\s+${SPEED}\s+${TYPE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${STATUS}\s+${DUPLEX}\s+${SPEED}\s+${TYPE}\s*$$ -> Record
